# Per-machine overrides — copy to ~/ (untracked) and edit.
#
# ~/.zshenv.local  — sourced from .zshenv, applies to interactive AND
#                    non-interactive shells (scripts, agents, cron).
#                    Put PATH/env entries here, e.g.:
#   [ -d "$HOME/.local/node24/bin" ] && PATH="$HOME/.local/node24/bin:$PATH"
#
# ~/.zshrc.local   — sourced at the end of .zshrc, interactive shells only.
#                    Put aliases, prompt tweaks, interactive secrets here.
